                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Barrett.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Barrett is directed to convey congratulations on President’s fortunate
                    escape.)</p>
